## Test Coverage Requirements

### Minimum Coverage

- **Models**: 90%+ (all CRUD, scopes, validations)
- **Repositories**: 85%+ (all methods, error cases)
- **Services**: 80%+ (all business logic, error cases)
- **Middleware**: 85%+ (all paths, error cases)
- **Controllers**: 80%+ (all endpoints, error cases)
- **Utilities**: 95%+ (all functions, edge cases)
- **Integration**: 70%+ (all endpoints, main flows)

